{"id":"n86862-1-7","stage":1,"title":"급하다 · 急","scene":"学校缺席","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86862-1-7-1","ko":"어제 왜 결석을 했어요?","zh":"昨天为什么缺席啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"결석을","meaning":"缺席，缺勤","explanation":"결석：缺席，缺勤；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결석","audio":"/audio/9862fb8a54b995f22c39.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15967","senseId":"1","lemma":"결석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결석을","audio":"/audio/b4c6e4b0775fb3bab67f.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요?","meaning":"缺席了","explanation":"하다 与 결석 合用为 결석하다，表示“缺席”；-었- 表示过去，-어요? 是礼貌问句。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9862fb8a54b995f2","term":"결석","zh":"缺席，缺勤","audio":"/audio/9862fb8a54b995f22c39.mp3","entryId":"15967","definition":"不去学校或不出席会议等正式场合。","pronunciation":["결썩"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"缺席（与 결석 合用）","au