，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"없었어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었어요","audio":"/audio/2ac65f9511472d67215d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"处境或情况处于需要赶紧处理的状态。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"2389c7672871f281","term":"사정","zh":"处境，情况，原因，缘由","audio":"/audio/2389c7672871f28155a7.mp3","entryId":"15669","definition":"事情的状况及原因。","pronunciation":["사ː정"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来、来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别处向说话人所在或所指的地方移动；这里是来学校。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bec6d7beab2a7b5621f6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.307,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86862","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语